+     mort_* siblings they are NOT initialised by new_tree, hence garbage for any tree that
+     has not yet been through mortality_tree_ind (i.e. at the first `pre` after a restart
+     and at a recruit's own establishment year) — only the `mort` phase is meaningful. */
+  Real bm_delta;                    /**< bm_inc.carbon/nind - turnover_ind.carbon (gC/ind) > */
+  Real leafarea_real;               /**< ind.leaf.carbon*sla, the realized leaf area (m2) > */
 } Pfttree;
 
